---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="What's new · Niyora"
  description="Every Niyora release in plain language, newest first. What changed in the app, what got fixed, and what the next version is being built around."
  ogImage="https://assets.niyora.com/niyora-launch-poster.jpg"
  canonicalUrl="https://niyora.com/changelog/"
>
  <section class="s left">
    <div class="log">
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Niyora</a>
      <h1>What's new</h1>
      <p class="lead">Every Niyora release, in plain language. Newest first.</p>

      <article class="release">
        <header>
          <h2>v0.4.0</h2>
          <span class="date">May 24, 2026</span>
        </header>
        <ul>
          <li>iPhone Companion (Beta). New card at the bottom of My Soul. Pair your iPhone to measure your calm with the camera, before and after a breath. Early access.</li>
          <li>Opt-in anonymous analytics. Off by default. Toggle in onboarding.</li>
          <li>App version visible at the bottom of My Soul.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="release">
        <header>
          <h2>v0.3.0</h2>
          <span class="date">May 11, 2026</span>
        </header>
        <ul>
          <li>Windows support. Tray icon, panel, native toasts, installer.</li>
          <li>Tray icon spins gently during onboarding.</li>
          <li>Soft glow and cross-fade on the breathing phase label.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="release">
        <header>
          <h2>v0.2.0</h2>
          <span class="date">May 8, 2026</span>
        </header>
        <ul>
          <li>Styled installer on macOS.</li>
          <li>First-launch panel polish.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="release">
        <header>
          <h2>v0.1.2</h2>
          <span class="date">May 1, 2026</span>
        </header>
        <ul>
          <li>In-app auto-updates. Niyora keeps itself current.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="release">
        <header>
          <h2>v0.1.1</h2>
          <span class="date">May 1, 2026</span>
        </header>
        <ul>
          <li>Polish pass. Small fixes and visual refinements.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="release">
        <header>
          <h2>v0.1.0</h2>
          <span class="date">Apr 29, 2026</span>
        </header>
        <p class="release-lede">First public release.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Fourteen practices. Pranayama, mindfulness, grounding, self-compassion.</li>
          <li>My Soul. Your growing visual companion.</li>
          <li>Situational signals. Niyora reads your work rhythm and nudges when stress is building.</li>
          <li>Smart reminders.</li>
          <li>Practice picker and onboarding.</li>
          <li>Mac builds for Apple Silicon and Intel. Signed by Apple Developer ID and notarized.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <p class="foot">Want to know when the next one ships? <a href="/talk">Say hello</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  /* Page-specific: the release log column. */
  .log { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); }
  a.back {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  a.back:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }

  .log h1 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .log .lead { margin-bottom: 48px; }

  .release {
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .release header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .release h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }
  .release .date {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }
  .release-lede {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .release ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .release li {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.68);
    padding: 6px 0 6px 18px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .release li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 16px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.5);
  }

  .foot {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .foot a {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }
  .foot a:hover { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }
</style>
